<v Examiner>On paper there's no examiner to prompt you.

473
00:36:12.196 --> 00:36:15.784
<v Examiner>Write the confounders and why they persist, in one line.

474
00:36:15.784 --> 00:36:20.941
<v Examiner>Investigations: the table structure was right, and you were strong on SSEPs and EEG.

475
00:36:20.941 --> 00:36:27.051
<v Examiner>But you left the limitation off neuron-specific enolase and off the motor examination until prompted.

